# Remote rules – project overview

This ruleset is intended to be used as **remote rules** (e.g. added via Cursor Settings → Rules → Add from GitHub).

- Prefer clear, actionable instructions over long prose.
- One concern per rule file; use `globs` for file-specific rules.
- Keep each rule under ~50 lines when possible.

Add or edit `.mdc` files in `.cursor/rules/` to extend this set.
